      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GREAT TERMS (7) is a well performed dog and winner of 19 races who was in the minor money last time out at this track (23.93). Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Ready to find winning form. LEGENDS TOLD (1) is mixing form lately, finishing out of the placings last time at this track but was a Grade 5 winner two back at this track. Has the ability and expected to do much better. SWAN'S SPIRIT (2) was drawn the middle but pinged the lids and led until the final stages, holding on for a place (23.67) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 407m. Form from his last run is proving strong. Likely to be in the finish again. DIXIE DEAN (4) is in form and worth thought again.",
